    <title>致命的“爱情”：海南海口连环凶杀案件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abc9006e742e36efcbd00c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abc9006e742e36efcbd00c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>一、导语</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>2011年4月14日凌晨，海口环海公路旁防洪堤，晨跑者发现一具全身赤裸的男尸。</span><br><span>死者没有头颅，颈部朝防洪堤，地面有喷射状血迹。</span><br><span>尸体旁有T恤、鞋、200元现金；不远处水泥墩后有一把水果刀；约3米外石缝中，警方找到头颅。</span><br><span>海风、潮水破坏现场，死者身上却有海沙。</span><br><span>他是谁？为什么赤身裸体？头为什么被割？凶手为什么如此残忍？</span></p></blockquote><p></p><p><strong><span>二、TIMELINE</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a></span><strong><span>&nbsp;防洪堤上的无头尸</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a></span><strong><span>&nbsp;身形高大的女友</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a></span><strong><span>&nbsp;网恋与安眠药</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a></span><strong><span>&nbsp;房子、官司与&nbsp;武全友之死</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> - 结束 </span><strong><span>消失的房东</span></strong></p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong><span>三、案件图片</span></strong></p><p><span>（第一名死者案发现场）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuddqXXLDORa6VDvf8oSIn5JJdRe.png"><p><span>（根据现场物证还原死者情况）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjj3EM29BnTA5T-Bn0VHSEoxBbPS.png"><p><span>（第二名死者赵军被发现）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3a1OfF-H5t4dlcaMGx4F5oRW26.png"><p><span>（犯罪嫌疑人）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuFNguAZRZCOhe5k-GIyCoadYvA.png"><p></p><p><strong><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、qq音乐、网易云音乐平台订阅我们~</span></strong></p>]]></description>
