    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>导语：</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>广西荔浦，以芋头出名。2014年夏天，让它出了名的却是一桩命案。</span></p><p><span>凌晨两点，烟摊老板倒在自家门口的巷子里，大腿被一刀刺穿，血淌干了。</span></p><p><span>凶手没拿走一分钱，却在地上留下了一张20块钱纸币。</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>TIMELINE：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a>案发背景介绍</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>三个嫌疑人</span></p></li></ul><blockquote><p><span>有前科在现场逃跑嫌疑人</span></p><p><span>现女友的前男友</span></p><p><span>有纠纷老主顾</span></p></blockquote><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a>案件真相</span></p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>图片:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>（案发现场血流成河）</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjYL8jzWqsKmfHSh3zlkMdjxeAl1.png"><ul><li><p><span>（死者女友回忆案发前异状）</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/For0B9MeicIjSGVRL7Ly20W57ZVz.png"><p><span>（警方锁定嫌疑人）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FskbknmO4V6LAo505887CzYt8UD0.png"><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、qq音乐、网易云音乐平台订阅我们~</span></strong></p>]]></description>
