  <item>
    <title>望远镜里的女人：江苏常州家庭主妇遇害案件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a753cc7000a55a9bb042164</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a753cc7000a55a9bb042164</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>导语</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>李莎是个普通的家庭主妇。</span></p><p><span>每天接送孩子、做饭、收拾家务，日子过得平淡安稳。她跟谁都没有仇，跟谁都没有怨。</span></p><p><span>但有人用望远镜盯上了她。</span></p><p><span>那个人住在对面楼里，她从来没有见过他，也根本不知道他的存在。</span></p><p><span>而他选择她，只因为她"总是一个人在家"。</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>TIMELINE：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 9月11号的火灾</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 丈夫收到的奇怪的短信</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 对面单身男邻居</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a>监控里发现可疑的男子</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 案件真相</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong><span>图片:</span></strong></p><p><span>（起火单元楼）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fof1rgQsR0_3QhkfRTz6xNf3xVXO.png"><p><span>（现场搜检物证：一把剪刀和白酒瓶盖）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvIt3N4IZhQvuV4-NMlGFavxEdk9.png"><p><span>（受害人当天出现在监控里时间点）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft0WleydijV5bnnj4ZLwEJN0nVDP.png"><p><span>（受害人受伤情况示意图）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFR1nvaNrJsebF93_43NP7oM3xz.png"><p></p><p><strong><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎在小宇宙、qq音乐、网易云音乐平台订阅我们~</span></strong></p><p></p>]]></description>
